 lines += ['### '+title,'',causes[key],'',fixes[fix] if fix!='hardware' else 'Remove the duplicate generated front/left rail. Thin the retained rear rails around their measured sections and fuse their existing cut ends into one connected bar. Thin the existing loop normally and across X; extend only its existing lower neck into body contact. The generated cages remain the shape source.','']
