lines += ['', 'The base bake uses the established 0.1 mm / 0.25 mm body reach; the rear-only composite uses 0.6 mm / 1.2 mm. The map is 2048 pixels square. `bake-audit-before.json` and `bake-audit-after.json` distinguish actual ray normals from nearest-high reference ambiguity.','', 'Five-notch diagnostics cover cage/high/low density, smoothness, creases, split normals and normal-map raster support. `sector-diagnostics-after.json` records all five independent notch sectors. No image-based quality verdict is claimed.','', 'Suspension contact checks use deterministic surface samples and actual triangle proximity/containment. The bar is one connected watertight component; it intersects the loop and stays vertically clear of the body. Per-mesh clearances are in `extra-checks.json`.','', '## Artifacts and captures','',f'- `{OUT}/medal-fitted.blend`',f'- `{OUT}/medal-high.glb`',f'- `{OUT}/medal-low.glb`',f'- `{OUT}/medal-low-normalmapped.glb`',f'- `{OUT}/medal-low-normal.png`','']
